{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kriraghor API: M05 Moderation",
    "description": "Two members have submitted their NID. Reviewer B (approve_documents) works the queue: claims the first (master A is told who holds it), keeps the lock with a heartbeat, ticks the rubric on the server and approves; claims the second and rejects it with a reason. Master A reopens the rejection with step-up moderation.override (critical audit) and approves it. Both members end up active.\n\nUnattended: `node postman/run-m05.js` (uses the kriraghor_test database).\n\nRebuild this file with: node postman/build-collection-m05.js",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
